/-!
# RARE rule names

The name of a RARE rule as it appears in an Alethe `rare_rewrite` step (`"bool-eq-true"`) mapped to
cvc5's `ProofRewriteRule` constructor (`BOOL_EQ_TRUE`). Generated from lean-cvc5's
`ProofRewriteRule`; regenerate when the enumeration changes.
-/

namespace Smt.Alethe

/-- The `ProofRewriteRule` named by a RARE rule name, if any. -/
